M9 part 1 P2 change 1: msrv.sh tests its target list in a variable, removes without -f

Planning's ruling H. scripts/msrv.sh: the installed-target test reads
rustup's target list into a variable and greps the variable, since under
pipefail a grep -q leaving at its first match could fail the pipeline and
report an installed target as missing; the cleanup trap removes its own
directory with rm -r, without -f. Nothing else changes.

